### 12. Keyframe Session Fetched Inline During Token Generation — Blocking

**File:** [index.ts](file:///c:/Users/Sameer/Desktop/ConvergentAI/backend/src/index.ts#L66-L108)

The `/api/get-token` endpoint fetches the Keyframe session **synchronously** within the token generation flow:

```typescript
const kfRes = await fetch("https://api.keyframelabs.com/v1/sessions", { ... });
```

This external API call blocks the token response. If Keyframe's API is slow (500ms+), the user sees a longer "Connecting..." spinner.

**Fix:** Fetch the LiveKit token and Keyframe session in parallel:
```typescript
const [token, keyframeMetadata] = await Promise.all([
  at.toJwt(),
  fetchKeyframeSession(),
]);
```

