### 15. `floating-cta/index.tsx` — 1579-Line Monolith with 30+ State Variables

**File:** [index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Sameer/Desktop/ConvergentAI/src/components/floating-cta/index.tsx)

This single component manages 30+ `useState` calls, 8+ refs, multiple `useEffect`s with complex dependency arrays, and inline event handlers. Every state change triggers a re-render of the entire 1579-line component tree, including all child components.

> [!NOTE]
> This isn't a latency bug per se, but the sheer number of state variables means frequent unnecessary re-renders. React reconciliation on a tree this large adds up, especially on mobile devices.

